    "Apps and data inside each simulator are lost. `xcrun simctl delete unavailable` removes only stale ones." : {
      "comment" : "Developer lens: what deleting it costs. Keep text in backticks (commands) as is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps und Daten in jedem Simulator gehen verloren. `xcrun simctl delete unavailable` entfernt nur veraltete."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se pierden las apps y los datos de cada simulador. `xcrun simctl delete unavailable` elimina solo los obsoletos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les apps et données de chaque simulateur sont perdues. `xcrun simctl delete unavailable` ne supprime que les simulateurs obsolètes."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le app e i dati di ogni simulatore vanno persi. `xcrun simctl delete unavailable` rimuove solo quelli obsoleti."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各シミュレータ内のアプリとデータは失われます。`xcrun simctl delete unavailable`では、使われなくなったものだけが削除されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "각 시뮬레이터의 앱과 데이터가 사라집니다. `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`은 오래된 것만 제거합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps en gegevens in elke simulator gaan verloren. `xcrun simctl delete unavailable` verwijdert alleen verouderde."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os apps e os dados dentro de cada simulador são perdidos. `xcrun simctl delete unavailable` remove apenas os obsoletos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个模拟器中的 App 和数据都会丢失。`xcrun simctl delete unavailable` 只会移除过时的模拟器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個模擬器中的 App 和資料都會遺失。`xcrun simctl delete unavailable` 只會移除過時的模擬器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
