    "Every image, container, and volume. Trashing it loses them all; prefer `docker system prune` from Docker." : {
      "comment" : "Developer lens: what deleting it costs. Keep text in backticks (commands) as is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle Images, Container und Volumes. Beim Löschen gehen alle verloren; verwende besser `docker system prune` in Docker."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todas las imágenes, contenedores y volúmenes. Al trasladarlo a la papelera se pierden todos; mejor usa `docker system prune` desde Docker."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toutes les images, tous les conteneurs et volumes. La placer dans la corbeille les supprime tous ; préférez `docker system prune` depuis Docker."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tutte le immagini, i container e i volumi. Spostarlo nel Cestino li elimina tutti; meglio usare `docker system prune` da Docker."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すべてのイメージ、コンテナ、ボリュームです。ゴミ箱に入れるとすべて失われます。Dockerの`docker system prune`を使うことをお勧めします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "모든 이미지, 컨테이너 및 볼륨입니다. 휴지통으로 이동하면 모두 사라지므로 Docker에서 `docker system prune`을 사용하는 것이 좋습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle images, containers en volumes. Weggooien verwijdert ze allemaal; gebruik liever `docker system prune` vanuit Docker."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todas as imagens, contêineres e volumes. Colocá-la no Lixo apaga todos eles; prefira `docker system prune` pelo Docker."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有镜像、容器和数据卷。移到废纸篓会将它们全部丢失；最好在 Docker 中使用 `docker system prune`。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有映像檔、容器和資料卷。丟到垃圾桶會全部遺失；建議改用 Docker 的 `docker system prune`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
