    "Package tarballs. npm downloads them again; offline installs stop working until it refills." : {
      "comment" : "Developer lens: what deleting it costs. Keep text in backticks (commands) as is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paket-Tarballs. npm lädt sie erneut; Offline-Installationen funktionieren erst wieder, wenn der Cache gefüllt ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tarballs de paquetes. npm los vuelve a descargar; las instalaciones sin conexión dejan de funcionar hasta que se rellena."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Archives de paquets. npm les télécharge à nouveau ; les installations hors ligne ne fonctionnent plus tant que le cache n’est pas rempli."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tarball dei pacchetti. npm li scarica di nuovo; le installazioni offline non funzionano finché non si riempie."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "パッケージのtarballです。npmが再ダウンロードしますが、キャッシュが再び揃うまでオフラインでのインストールはできません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "패키지 tarball입니다. npm이 다시 다운로드하지만, 캐시가 다시 채워질 때까지 오프라인 설치가 작동하지 않습니다."
